To further investigate the PID capability of TOF, the signal to background ratios for \(\phi\)-meson and \(K^{0\star}\) are taken at low \(p_{T}\) and mid-\(p_{T}\) region, and shown on the Fig. 7.6. Ratios for phi on the left panel show significant enhancement in mid-\(p_{T}\) using "TOF+TPC" method, while \(K^{0\star}\) ratios on the right panel show similar enhancement factor in each \(p_{T}\) range.

